            <ArticleTitle>Medical problems affecting musicians.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2121-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The physical demands of performing on musical instruments can cause pain, sensory loss, and lack of coordination. Five cases illustrate common problems. Knowledge of the interaction between the technique of playing the instrument and the particular musician can help physicians diagnose and resolve problems.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
